[2026-10-07 16:04:22] [generation-agent.stderr] {"at":"2026-10-07T16:04:22.435Z","type":"probe_reviewed","packetId":"packet-req-5-1-2","detail":{"verdict":"corrected","rationale":"Run review of the two failed cases (save-two-condition-filter-view step 5; reject-duplicate-and-delete-filter-view step 9). In both, the preparation never made the seeded data region D3:F7 the current region, so \"Create filter\" produced no applied filter: case 1 shows the Data menu closed and no \"Filter Workstream\" button at all (matchCount 0) even though the initial checkpoint (Workload tab) passed, and case 3 shows the save dialog rejecting the save with \"Invalid filter\" instead of the required duplicate-name message, i.e. there was no currently applied filter to save. These are preparation gaps, not executed business results, so the outcome of neither case may be claimed. The fix is a public, requirement-anchored preparation step that selects the declared region D3:F7 before opening the Data menu, added to the setup prefix so the business suffix, its expect positions and the outcome mappings stay identical (setupStepCount 3 -> 4, positions p = index - setupStepCount unchanged). Case apply-persisted-filter-view is unaffected (no failure, no dependency on filter creation) and is left untouched. No expectation was lowered and no requirement coverage was dropped.","beforePlanSha256":"cd0454151f67a7dee62ca204040d9dae735a4f38f470452f6cd4e6a6f3bb45a2","planSha256":"8a651c134ed74fa5158bed86a45a31595a3b7912dda432166efda10abebcaa97","corrections":[{"caseId":"save-two-condition-filter-view","conflict":"The plan clicks \"Create filter\" in the \"Data\" menu while cell A1 (empty) is the active selection, so no filter is created for the seeded region D3:F7 and the header button \"Filter Workstream\" is never rendered (matchCount 0, empty Data menu in the snapshot). The WHEN clause \"creates a filter for D3:F7\" was therefore never executed; this is a preparation gap, not a business result, so the row-visibility expectations were never reached.","basis":["Users create a filter for a data region with headers in the current active worksheet through \"Create filter\" in the \"Data\" menu.","Each header provides a button with the accessible name \"Filter <header text>\"","range D3:F7 headed `Workstream/Phase/Load`"]},{"caseId":"reject-duplicate-and-delete-filter-view","conflict":"The plan clicks \"Create filter\" without first making the seeded data region D3:F7 the current region, so no filter was applied; the save dialog then rejects \"Save view\" with \"Invalid filter\" because there is no currently applied filter, and the required duplicate-name message cannot appear. The WHEN clause \"creates a filter for D3:F7\" was never executed and the conflict is a preparation gap, not an executed business result.","basis":["Users create a filter for a data region with headers in the current active worksheet through \"Create filter\" in the \"Data\" menu.","A currently applied filter can be saved through \"Save filter view\" in the","range D3:F7 headed `Workstream/Phase/Load`"]}]},"runId":"a7b177d7-5c5d-4056-8f45-99809e181deb","eventId":"a7b177d7-5c5d-4056-8f45-99809e181deb:205","sequence":205,"phase":"probe","elapsedMs":6193022,"acceptedSha":"dd090527a95fb3c040ca632088ccff85f40492d0","attempt":1}
